148
00:24:48.370 --> 00:24:59.090
Ningning Wu: So that means that research must follow organized steps to ensure logic, data collection, analysis, and interpretation.

149
00:24:59.440 --> 00:25:13.219
Ningning Wu: Then the next one is objective and embarrassed, so it means that all the conclusions drawn by the research must be based on the evidence, rather than the personal opinions.

